Week 1: Data Cleaning & Preparation
Objective
To clean and prepare the hotel booking dataset for analysis.
Dataset
Dataset: Hotel Booking Dataset
Records: ~119,390 rows
Columns: 32 features
Source: CSV file
Data Cleaning Steps
Checked dataset structure
Used .info() and .shape()
Handled missing values
children → filled with 0
country → filled with "Unknown"
agent → filled with 0
company → filled with 0
Removed inconsistencies
Ensured correct data types
Verified no major data errors
 Outcome
Clean dataset ready for analysis
No critical missing values
Structured and usable data
